            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>for döngüsünü tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nintendo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Xbox\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Nintendo\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>console</code> ve sonra <code>in</code>, <code>consoles</code>, <code>:</code>, <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>consoles</code> listesinde döngü kurup her öğeyi yazdır. Böylece çıktıda <code>Xbox</code>, <code>Playstation</code> ve <code>Nintendo</code> sıralansın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nintendo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;console&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Xbox\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Nintendo\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>console</code>, <code>in</code>, <code>consoles</code>, <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>console</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
