            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(user)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for</code> iki kez kullanılır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>:</code> eksik</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>for</code> iki kez kullanılır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü başlığı yerine hangisi yazılırsa kod her kullanıcıyı görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(user)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for user in users:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for user for users:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in user for users:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>for user in users:</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
